            "line": 1344,
            "text": "theorem directionRatio_entrance_bound (v : TailData) {y η : ℝ} (hh1 : v.h ≤ 1 / 100)\n    (hy : 0 ≤ y) (hyT : y ≤ v.core.holdStart) (hη : |η| ≤ 1)\n    (hhT : v.h ≤ Real.exp (-(v.core.holdStart + 3 / 5)) / 8) :\n    |directionRatio v y η| ≤ entranceRatioBound v.core.P v.core.m"
